@startuml

hide footbox
title US0014 - To get publication types list

box  #LightYellow
actor User
participant ":UI" as UI
end box

participant ":GetPublicationTypeController" as GetPublicationTypeController
participant ":PublicationTypeRepository" as PublicationTypeRepository

User -> UI : **1** I want to get a list of all publication types
activate UI

UI -> GetPublicationTypeController : **2** getPublicationTypesList()
activate GetPublicationTypeController

GetPublicationTypeController -> PublicationTypeRepository : **3** findAllPublicationTypes()
activate PublicationTypeRepository

PublicationTypeRepository --> GetPublicationTypeController : **4** List<PublicationTypes>
deactivate PublicationTypeRepository

GetPublicationTypeController --> UI : **5** List<PublicationTypes>
deactivate GetPublicationTypeController

UI --> User : **6** Official List of Publication Types



@enduml